      "message": "Please fix this WARNING reported by autoreview issue finding: When `CONFIG_CHARGER` (or `CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_CHARGER`) is disabled, `p-\u003emode` is not validated. If the host sends an invalid mode (e.g., `CHARGE_CONTROL_COUNT` or any arbitrary value), the command will skip the `CHARGE_CONTROL_NORMAL` block, skip the `#if defined(CONFIG_CHARGER)` block, save `-1, -1, 0` to BBRAM, and silently return `EC_HOST_CMD_SUCCESS`. It should instead validate `p-\u003emode` or return `EC_HOST_CMD_INVALID_PARAM` for unsupported modes when the charger is disabled.",
